<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" ?>
<Defs>

  <!-- ==================================================================
       FEATS, batch two: the class feats.

       Each requires levels in the class whose ability it modifies - always
       at least the level that GRANTS the ability, so a feat can never be
       owned before the thing it changes. The mods themselves are declared
       here and consulted by the ability comps at cast time, so everything
       works identically in turn-based and real-time combat.

       Deferred to the starred batch (new combat hooks, not data): the
       Warden's Opportunity Attacks, the Rogue's Backstab, the Monk's
       Running Start, and the general Last Stand.
       ================================================================== -->

